title False-Positive Detection

Entry [icon: shield, color: red] {
  ALERT [icon: alert-triangle, label: "Alert"]
}

Signals (parallel) [icon: database, color: orange] {
  SUPPRESS [icon: filter,  label: "Suppression rules"]
  ASSETS   [icon: server,  label: "Asset context"]
  IOCS     [icon: hash,    label: "IOC memory"]
  RECALL   [icon: history, label: "Past insights"]
}

Triage [icon: brain-circuit, color: blue] {
  FAST [icon: zap,      label: "Asset fast-FP\n(skip LLM)"]
  LLM  [icon: activity, label: "Triage LLM\n→ is_fp, confidence"]
}

Decide [icon: git-branch, color: purple] {
  GATE [icon: scale,      label: "Confidence gate"]
  AGG  [icon: calculator, label: "FP aggregator\n(weighted score)"]
}

Outcomes [icon: flag, color: green] {
  FP      [icon: x-circle,     label: "FALSE_POSITIVE"]
  TRIAGED [icon: check-circle, label: "TRIAGED"]
}

Review [icon: users, color: teal] {
  CONFIRM  [icon: thumbs-up,  label: "Analyst confirms"]
  OVERRIDE [icon: rotate-ccw, label: "Analyst overrides"]
}

Learn [icon: sparkles, color: pink] {
  STATS   [icon: trending-up, label: "Update IOC stats"]
  SUGGEST [icon: lightbulb,   label: "FP suggestion"]
  PROMOTE [icon: plus-circle, label: "New suppression rule"]
}

ALERT > SUPPRESS
ALERT > ASSETS
ALERT > IOCS
ALERT > RECALL
ASSETS > FAST
FAST > FP: short-circuit
SUPPRESS > LLM
ASSETS > LLM
IOCS > LLM
RECALL > LLM
LLM > GATE
GATE > FP: high confidence
GATE > AGG: continue
AGG > FP: score ≥ 0.55
AGG > TRIAGED
FP > CONFIRM
FP > OVERRIDE
CONFIRM > STATS
OVERRIDE > STATS
STATS > SUGGEST
SUGGEST > PROMOTE
PROMOTE > SUPPRESS
